      "abstractions": [
        "Eight guidance sessions and four route identities. stopGuidance moves the session counter even when no session is active; the model leaves it then, since there is no session to tell apart.",
        "The location owner is its admission flag and the session it admitted; NativeMapsLocation models its internals. The screen-off session is the set of starts in flight and the session BackgroundNavigation holds; BackgroundNavigation models its bridge calls.",
        "A fix is one of unusable, at the destination, on the route or off it. Maneuver progress, the reroute-cleared handshake and exact retry delays are in NavigationProgress.",
        "The controller is its route phase and a route identity. A ready route outside a reroute always differs from the route being followed.",
        "A screen-off start that fails after the page was hidden leaves guidance running without a native session: HiddenGuidanceHasNativeSessionDesired is outside safety and backgroundStartFailingWhileHiddenTest replays it.",
        "Events that end a session are drawn less often in step so sampled traces reach long sessions; every one stays enabled."
      ]
    },
