      "abstractions": [
        "The search text is present or absent; the selection is a place or the current location; the starting point is empty, the device's location, typed text or a chosen place. Saved places, dropped pins, renames and sharing do not change the mode.",
        "User actions are enabled in the modes that draw their control, which is the template's behaviour; agent requests are refused while guidance is active, as device-navigation checks.",
        "The shared controller is its origin kind, whether its position is ready, and whether a located fix is pending. Route planning settles nondeterministically.",
        "The hand-off microtask may interleave with other actions here; in the browser it runs before the next event.",
        "Back from the route sheet leaves its location request pending, and the fix then replaces the place on screen with the current location: OriginFixNeverReplacesPlaceDesired is outside safety and backFromRouteSheetBeforeFixTest replays it.",
        "The Calendar event return, the external maps app hand-off and map-plane loading are not modeled."
      ]
    },
